cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "Activation Functions Benchmark: A Controlled PyTorch Study of Nonlinearity in Deep MLPs"
abstract: >-
  A controlled comparison of Sigmoid, Tanh, ReLU, and LeakyReLU in a deep
  multilayer perceptron on the two-moons dataset, covering optimization speed,
  gradient flow, dead and saturated units, and test accuracy across five seeds.
